{"articleNo":"677","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=677&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-1 대학원 수료자등록(추가)신청자고지서출력/등록안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.11","hit":"17548","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"367\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"41\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009-1학기 대학원 수료자등록(추가)신청자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">고지서 출력 및 등록 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;2009-1학기 대학원 수료자등록 (추가)신청을 완료한 학생은 아래와 같이 등록절차를 이행하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 수료자등록 신청자 등록금 납부 금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#000000\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5% </font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#000000\">논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부기간 : <font color=\"#1e90ff\">2009. 3. 5(목) ~ 3. 6(금) [2일간]</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력 :&nbsp;<u><strong><font color=\"#c71585\">원스톱서비스/로그인/등록/등록금고지서조회 및 출력</font> </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#191970\"><strong>문의처: 478-7115(경리팀)</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : 농협중앙회 전국 각 지점</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"111\" bgcolo